# Source renders that tools/cutout.py consumes. At fs-penalty these stayed
# tracked, 22 MB of them, in a public repo — still downloadable from
# raw.githubusercontent.com long after Pages was cleaned. The art is
# reproducible from the prompts in docs/ART.md, so the blobs never need to be.
raw/

# Placeholder art carried over from fs-penalty so the ported page runs while
# the Top Win art is being made. Neither belongs in this repo's history: the
# keeper wears FanSport's kit and the plate is graded to their green/purple.
# Both are generative work, so they wait for Etapa 3, which replaces them and
# deletes this block. The ball used to be listed here too -- it was painted
# with FanSport's brand colours despite the plan calling it brand-neutral --
# but it came from a recipe in this repo, so it was simply repainted.
assets/img/keeper-*.webp
assets/img/pitch-spot.webp
